&lt;p&gt;You try to pin down a date or an intent, and the talk does not resolve. It spins into &lt;strong&gt;chaos&lt;/strong&gt;, while the fight you meant to finish sits under a stack of old complaints and stories that keep changing shape.&lt;/p&gt;
